+  "GET /probe returns 200 with an HTML FRAGMENT", the link exists "so
+  non-JS visitors can reach the fragment page", "the no-JS flow reaches the
+  same form via a plain link" — an unrenderable document reaches nothing.
+  Per rule 3 FIRST bullet the test stays as written: BLOCKED.
+- Why no honest green exists: (a) app code is outside my "Never" fence;
